# Environment / Secrets
# ============================================================

# Environment files
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Local development configuration
appsettings.Local.json
appsettings.Development.local.json

# IMPORTANT:
# Do not ignore normal appsettings.json or appsettings.Development.json
# automatically if they contain non-sensitive project configuration.
#
# Store real passwords/API keys/secrets in:
# - User Secrets
# - Environment Variables
# - Azure Key Vault / Secret Manager
# - CI/CD Secret Variables


# ============================================================
# Certificates / Private Keys
# ============================================================

*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem

# If your repository intentionally contains public certificates,
# add specific exceptions rather than committing private keys.


